msgctxt "diagnostic"
msgid "following {label}; sweep sample rate matches that DAW project"
msgstr "suivi de {label} ; la fréquence du balayage correspond à ce projet DAW"

msgid ""
"More than one DAW project is in play. Say which one RoomScope should "
"follow; it will not guess. The sweep sample rate follows the chosen "
"project."
msgstr ""
"Plusieurs projets DAW sont en cours. Indiquez lequel RoomScope doit "
"suivre ; il ne devinera pas. La fréquence du balayage suit le projet "
"choisi."

msgid "Use --daw NAME and, if that name is shared, --daw-project TITLE."
msgstr "Utilisez --daw NOM et, si ce nom est partagé, --daw-project TITRE."

msgid "DAW name is required"
msgstr "Le nom du DAW est requis"

msgid "none of the open DAW projects is {name}. RoomScope will not guess"
msgstr "aucun des projets DAW ouverts n’est {name}. RoomScope ne devinera pas"

